WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:11,860
Handsome guy, try it. These potatoes are quite fragrant.

2
00:00:14,100 --> 00:00:16,300
No, there's a ghost in the rear.

3
00:00:16,300 --> 00:00:17,900
It won't take half an hour to catch up.

4
00:00:20,890 --> 00:00:23,290
Captain Shen, hurry up and leave. There is danger behind you.

5
00:00:25,480 --> 00:00:28,680
Are you sure I can see the danger directly? Trust me.

6
00:00:29,240 --> 00:00:31,240
Everyone get on the bus and leave immediately

7
00:00:31,240 --> 00:00:45,050
Damn it, I can fly away from the rain

8
00:00:45,050 --> 00:00:46,650
This speed is faster than a sports car

9
00:00:46,650 --> 00:00:47,850
That's definitely an extraordinary drama

10
00:00:47,850 --> 00:00:49,250
Idiot, stop standing there and drive quickly.

11
00:00:49,650 --> 00:00:54,620
It's skateboarding, it's an extraordinary drama

12
00:00:54,620 --> 00:00:56,020
I was worried about being targeted before

13
00:00:56,020 --> 00:00:57,820
Now, there's no need to hide

14
00:00:58,420 --> 00:01:03,640
Wait, drive southwest.

15
00:01:03,640 --> 00:01:06,040
The upgrade options I see are all in that direction.

16
00:01:06,040 --> 00:01:07,840
How about you just lead the way from the front?

17
00:01:07,840 --> 00:01:08,840
Your skateboard is fast enough

18
00:01:08,840 --> 00:01:11,040
No, no, no, you are the captain. Lead the way.

19
00:01:11,040 --> 00:01:12,440
Xiao Linzhuo is sensible

20
00:01:12,440 --> 00:01:14,640
Not sensible yet, still afraid of death

21
00:01:14,640 --> 00:01:15,640
There is also danger in the southwest

22
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:22,100
But the intensity is not too high. Team Shen pays attention to the danger.
